WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.533
When your dental front desk is busy or closed, an

00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:06.367
appointment enquiry can end before anyone helps.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:10.833
Flow Audit is an AI phone agent supporting your team

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:11.867
through agreed workflows.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.533
The separate recording below shows an enquiry,

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:17.967
available times and a Google Calendar booking, with

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:19.533
privacy beeps and edited labels.

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.333
It's demonstration evidence,

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.033
not customer results.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.867
Published US exam, cleaning and X-ray costs range from

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:28.633
$50 to $350.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:31.967
That's a fee benchmark, not a revenue forecast.

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:34.767
Use your own attendance, collections and costs.

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:37.467
Missed calls aren't automatically lost patients.

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.967
Your scheduling system, appointment types and

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:41.100
forwarding need checking.

00:00:41.533 --> 00:00:44.500
Compatibility, patient-data and security requirements

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.367
must be resolved before proceeding.

00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:53.067
Urgent calls follow practice-approved escalation and

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:54.000
human-handoff rules.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.333
The recorded question doesn't establish validated

00:00:57.333 --> 00:01:00.133
clinical triage or a completed emergency handoff.

00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:02.567
Clinical judgment stays with your team.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.667
Agree scope and investment first.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.533
Agreement and initial payment start configuration,

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.933
followed by testing with your team.

00:01:11.533 --> 00:01:13.733
Practice approval comes before activation.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.633
Book a 15-minute demo and fit assessment.

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:21.933
Bring your purchasing decision-maker.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:24.567
Groups should include relevant approvers.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:27.933
We'll discuss requirements, investment and the next

00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:28.933
decision.
